  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xf6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will assist in the establishment of a functioning organization for land and immovable property registration, on central and local levels. Through institutional cooperation NLS will advice and support on issues such as; most suitable organization for land administration, competence requirements, business strategies, capacity development, information to the public, self-financing, etc.</narrative>
